      "page": 598,
      "ruku": 539,
      "hizbQuarter": 239,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 6131,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve from the People of the Book and the polytheists were not going to desist [from disbelief][1] until there came to them clear proof,",
